cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "US Traffic Ticket Courts and Payment Portals"
abstract: >
  A machine-readable reference for US traffic tickets: 54 city records and 21
  state records covering the court or agency that handles the citation, its
  official payment or contest portal, the fine structure, point consequences,
  and whether a traffic course dismisses the case, withholds adjudication, only
  reduces points, or does not exist.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "TicketSimplified"
    website: "https://ticketsimplified.com/"
version: 2026.10.13
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: CC0-1.0
url: "https://github.com/odebo/us-traffic-ticket-data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/odebo/us-traffic-ticket-data"
keywords:
  - "traffic tickets"
  - "traffic court"
  - "open data"
  - "United States"

